{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04738","headline":"春晚侍宴丽正殿探得开字 · 张说","name":"春晚侍宴丽正殿探得开字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣政惟稽古，宾门引上才。\n坊因购书立，殿爲集贤开。\n髦彦星辰下，仙章日月回。\n字如龙负出，韵是凤衔来。\n庭柳余春驻，宫莺早夏催。\n喜承芸阁宴，幸奉柏梁杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}